   * reproduced verbatim from teeth-whitening.astro:708-713.
   *
   * Keyed per PAGE rather than per component on purpose. The band is the same
   * LocalTrust in both places, but its heading, intro and body are page copy,
   * so one shared key would put "for Clear Aligners" on the whitening page.
   * That is why the key is <page>_<anchor> and why adding a page means adding
   * an entry here AND a choice in BLOCK_CODE_BANDS — miss either and the row
   * writes fine, resolves to nothing, and the band disappears from a live page
   * with only a console warning.
   */
  teeth_whitening_local: {
    component: LocalTrust,
    props: {
      heading: "Whitening Designed",
      headingItalic: "in Parker, Colorado",
      intro:
        "Patients come for KOR whitening locally and from out of state — every appointment starts with the same shade-and-staining consultation, regardless of how far you travel for it.",
