   * content, so reusing `local_trust` here would put "for Clear Aligners" under
   * a veneers heading. Key stays <page>_<anchor>; the anchor is `local` because
   * that is what LocalTrust's `id` defaults to and what this page has always
   * rendered.
   *
   * This page passes the SAME four props as the other two and no others — no
   * `background`, `eyebrow`, `note`, `ctas` or `id`. The band it draws is
   * therefore the cream default, which is what belongs between `lasting` and
