   * SAME COMPONENT general-dentistry's `general_dentistry_trust` names.
   * `.section.dark` on both pages, `.trust-quote` > eyebrow.light, h2,
   * `p.trust-body` ×2, `p.trust-attr` with the aria-hidden stars — TrustBand
   * draws exactly that and hardcodes the band, so there is nothing to add.
   *
   * Keyed per PAGE, not per component, for the reason the three LocalTrust
   * entries above state: heading, body and body2 are page copy.
   *
   * FROZEN FROM THE CMS: `sections[why-us]` heading and body. The eyebrow,
   * `body2` (html-bearing) and `attr` are the template's own literals
   * (emergency-dentistry/index.astro:377-390) and were never editable.
   */
