   * RENDERABLE, and both are named here because a prop this table passes and
   * the component ignores is a band that draws the wrong thing with no error:
   *
   *   `band`    — "paper" (today's behaviour and the default, so the three hub
   *               bands are untouched) | "charcoal". This page's band is
   *               `<section class="section alt">`
   *               (emergency-dentistry/index.astro:398), and AreaBand emits a
   *               bare `class="section"`. The component also needs the charcoal
   *               text colours for `.area-copy`, lifted from
   *               emergency-dentistry.css:327-349 with the citation.
